{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured a persistent web service on node1 at 127.0.0.1:8081. Loopback requests succeed, requests to external address 10.100.62.10:8081 are refused, and the service recovered automatically after a verified node reboot.","actions_performed":["Installed an unprivileged Python HTTP service bound exclusively to 127.0.0.1:8081.","Created, enabled, and started loopback-web.service.","Verified loopback success and external-interface refusal before restart.","Restarted node1 once using a safely deferred native systemd reboot.","Confirmed the boot ID changed and repeated all health and reachability checks successfully."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Web service is persistent and active on TCP port 8081","command_ids":["cmd-79b4ee4e5bb049f9","cmd-14065ace6be042d5","cmd-6021b9ecc54f4882"],"summary":"The unit is enabled and active; before and after restart, netstat shows only 127.0.0.1:8081 listening and the health endpoint returns the expected content."},{"requirement":"Service is reachable through loopback but not through external interfaces","command_ids":["cmd-14065ace6be042d5","cmd-6021b9ecc54f4882"],"summary":"Both checks show a successful response through 127.0.0.1 and connection refusal through node1's external address 10.100.62.10."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-14065ace6be042d5","cmd-4d4d658509c244cb","cmd-47bc4863ba804969","cmd-6021b9ecc54f4882"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID was 9ed9e820-6949-4971-a6a0-9fda0c2ea7ee; the restart was acknowledged; node1 returned with boot ID 7b80e9c9-4b62-4722-97fb-8545da02beed; system state, service, listener, application checksum, loopback response, and external refusal were all verified after recovery."}]}
